+
+**Acceptance (critic checks the `header` rows of `captures/CAPTURE.md`), most important first:**
+
+- Three tile rects at x = 24, 224, 424, each 192 × 96 at y = 84, rx 8, fill `#f3f4f6`: the row spans 24 … 616 with 8px gaps, equal widths.
+- In every tile: label at y = 108 (11px, 600, muted, upper-case), value at y = 146 (28px, 700, ink), change at y = 166 (12px, 600) — the three values share one baseline, the three labels another, the three changes another.
