+- Changes read `▲ 12.4% vs prior period` in `#1a7f37`, `▼ 3.1% vs prior period` in `#c62828`, `▲ 15.8% vs prior period` in `#1a7f37`: Orders reads as a fall at a glance.
+- Title `Northwind Stores` at (24,40) 20px weight 600 ink; period `12 months to August 2026` at (24,60) 12px muted; both at the margin, above the tiles.
+- Only header colours used: `#1f2933`, `#6b7280`, `#f3f4f6`, `#1a7f37`, `#c62828`. Fourteen header elements, in the order shown. `npm test` passes.
